{"path":"/case-studies/channelsight/","slug":"case-studies__channelsight","kind":"case-study","title":"ChannelSight Case Study: Making a Commerce Platform Readable to AI Engines | Legency Media","description":"ChannelSight is a where-to-buy and digital shelf platform for consumer brands. It connects buy-now intent on a brand's website, media and campaigns to live retailer product pages, and measures the whole path from content to checkout.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/_slug_.CjSPQXea.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"cs-hero\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container cs-hero__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"cs-hero__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Case Study</span><span class=\"cs-hero__client\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"cs-hero__logo\" src=\"/img/partners/channelsight.png\" alt=\"ChannelSight\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y></span><h1 class=\"cs-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Making a Commerce Platform Readable to AI Engines</h1><aside class=\"side-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"side-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h2 data-no-roll class=\"side-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Our role</h2><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"side-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>ChatGPT, Gemini, Claude, Perplexity and Google’s AI answers cite ChannelSight ahead of every competitor. Case studies and industry pages now run on reusable sections the marketing team edits itself.</p></aside></div><figure class=\"cs-hero__media\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"case-visual\" src=\"/img/case-studies/channelsight-photo-1440.webp\" srcset=\"/img/case-studies/channelsight-photo-800.webp 800w, /img/case-studies/channelsight-photo-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 94vw, 45vw\" alt=\"ChannelSight homepage on a silver MacBook on lavender acrylic among retail packaging.\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1008\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr><figcaption data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>ChannelSight. Technical search improvements and ongoing Webflow development.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dl class=\"cs-stats\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dt data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>most-cited source across six AI assistants</dt><dd data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>No. 1</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dt data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>case studies rebuilt on reusable sections</dt><dd data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>15</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dt data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>new industry pages live</dt><dd data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>8</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=\"challenge\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container challenge__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Challenge</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"challenge__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The only company in its category that AI engines could not read.</h2></div><div class=\"challenge__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>ChannelSight is a where-to-buy and digital shelf platform for consumer brands. It connects buy-now intent on a brand&#39;s website, media and campaigns to live retailer product pages, and measures the whole path from content to checkout.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The company was repositioning around AI and agentic commerce, and its own site published no structured data at all. Not on the homepage, not on the product pages, not even on the FAQ page where the answers were already written. Every direct competitor published it. In mid-June, zero pages on ChannelSight&#39;s site carried it.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Search told the same story. 371 blog posts and all 14 case studies were going out with empty search titles or descriptions, the homepage title read ChannelSight.ai and nothing else, and crawlers were spending their time on 2,349 junk URLs. On our own 100-point readability audit the site scored 30.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"solution section\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container solution__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"solution__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Solution</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"solution__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Making every page legible to machines.</h2></div><div class=\"solution__cards\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Structured Data, Site-Wide</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Organization markup across the site and Article markup on every blog post, plus FAQ and Breadcrumb. Then JSON-LD written by hand onto the 33 pages that do the selling: five product pages marked up as software, the how-it-works set, and 19 topic cluster pages.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Snippets and Titles the Site Never Had</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>371 blog posts and all 14 case studies were given a written search title and description, each built from that page&#39;s own summary or opening lines. 385 pages in total. The homepage title went from a bare brand name to a line that says what the company actually does.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Crawl Budget Pointed at Real Pages</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 9L18.005 20.3463C17.8369 21.3026 17.0062 22 16.0353 22H7.96474C6.99379 22 6.1631 21.3026 5.99496 20.3463L4 9\"/><path d=\"M21 6L15.375 6M3 6L8.625 6M8.625 6V4C8.625 2.89543 9.52043 2 10.625 2H13.375C14.4796 2 15.375 2.89543 15.375 4V6M8.625 6L15.375 6\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Pagination was blocked in the robots file so engines stopped crawling thousands of near-duplicate URLs, and every page was given a canonical tag declaring its own address. A hand-written llms.txt replaced a 714-line generated file whose homepage entry was blank.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"outcome\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"outcome__head\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Outcome</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"outcome__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The most-cited domain in the sample.</h2></div><div class=\"outcome__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>475 Pages Machine-Readable, From Zero</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A full crawl of all 586 pages on 15 July confirmed 475 carrying structured data, where mid-June had none. Low-value URLs in the crawl fell from 2,349 to 410, a drop of 83%.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>385 Pages Given a Search Snippet</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M20.5 20.5L22 22\"/><path d=\"M15 18C15 19.6569 16.3431 21 18 21C18.8299 21 19.581 20.663 20.1241 20.1185C20.6654 19.5758 21 18.827 21 18C21 16.3431 19.6569 15 18 15C16.3431 15 15 16.3431 15 18Z\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Every one of the 371 blog posts and 14 case studies that had been publishing blank now carries a written title and description, so the result says what the page is about before anyone clicks.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Readability Score, 30 to 59</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Our own 100-point audit, re-run identically two months later. The two categories the June audit called lowest and highest-leverage are the two that moved: structured data 0 to 18 of 30, technical foundations 1 to 12 of 25.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Most-Cited Domain in the Panel</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 12.5C17.2761 12.5 17.5 12.2761 17.5 12C17.5 11.7239 17.2761 11.5 17 11.5C16.7239 11.5 16.5 11.7239 16.5 12C16.5 12.2761 16.7239 12.5 17 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 12.5C12.2761 12.5 12.5 12.2761 12.5 12C12.5 11.7239 12.2761 11.5 12 11.5C11.7239 11.5 11.5 11.7239 11.5 12C11.5 12.2761 11.7239 12.5 12 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7 12.5C7.27614 12.5 7.5 12.2761 7.5 12C7.5 11.7239 7.27614 11.5 7 11.5C6.72386 11.5 6.5 11.7239 6.5 12C6.5 12.2761 6.72386 12.5 7 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 13.8214 2.48697 15.5291 3.33782 17L2.5 21.5L7 20.6622C8.47087 21.513 10.1786 22 12 22Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Fourteen real buyer questions went to ChatGPT, Claude, Perplexity and Gemini on 15 July 2026. channelsight.com was the most-cited domain of any kind, ahead of MikMak, Pear and Wayvia combined. Weekly checks across six AI assistants still ranked it first on 12 October 2026.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Built to Be Re-Measured</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The June baseline existed to be re-run: same checks, same scoring, same crawl. Every number here is a before and an after taken the same way, so the next round is measured rather than asserted.</p></article></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".cs-hero .label,.challenge .label,.solution .label,.work-hero .label{color:#625e5e}.site-footer .closer__scene{filter:grayscale()}.case-visual[data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr]{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);height:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);background:var(--blue);color:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);flex-shrink:0;place-items:center;display:grid}.icon-chip--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{background:#ffffff1a;border:1px solid #ffffff47}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:inherit;background:0 0;border:0}.icon-chip--muted[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:#201d1d8c;background:#201d1d0f;border:1px solid #201d1d1a}.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:58%;height:58%;display:block}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:100%;height:100%}","html.lenis,html.lenis body{height:auto}.lenis:not(.lenis-autoToggle).lenis-stopped{overflow:clip}.lenis [data-lenis-prevent],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-wheel],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-touch],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-vertical],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-horizontal]{overscroll-behavior:contain}.lenis.lenis-smooth iframe{pointer-events:none}.lenis.lenis-autoToggle{transition-behavior:allow-discrete;transition-property:overflow;transition-duration:1ms}"]}